nd underestimate risk in others."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Pregnancy, children, older age, disability, and ethnicity may need a more individualized interpretation. A clinician can help select additional measures."}]],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Use this information carefully"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Health advice works best when adapted to your own situation. A BMI result can be a useful opening measure, but it should never replace individualized medical care."}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 p-4 text-sm dark:bg-slate-800","children":["This material is for education and does not replace personal medical advice. ",["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/disclaimer","className":"text-teal-700 underline","children":"Read the medical disclaimer."}]]}]]}]}]],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/2n5i-92m-bb14.js","async":true}]],["$","$L5",null,{"children":["$","$6",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@7"}]}]]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"zGaTm9otQK25VABIhSGDn"}
